WEBVTT

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.546
Okay. Open your eyes.

00:02:05.086 --> 00:02:08.189
I want to tell you
about a very bizarre contest

00:02:08.213 --> 00:02:10.851
that is held every spring
in New York City.

00:02:11.475 --> 00:02:14.498
It's called the United States
Memory Championship.

00:02:14.522 --> 00:02:17.236
And I had gone to cover
this contest a few years back

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:19.125
as a science journalist,

00:02:19.149 --> 00:02:24.597
expecting, I guess, that this was going
to be like the Superbowl of savants.

00:02:25.388 --> 00:02:28.632
This was a bunch of guys and a few ladies,

00:02:28.656 --> 00:02:32.121
widely varying in both age
and hygienic upkeep.